0-puffs","title":"Elfbar Pi9000 (9000 Puffs)","description":"\u003cp\u003eFor vapers looking for a beginner vaping device you're at right place, the Elf Bar Pi9000 disposable vape is a fantastic choice. It’s ideal for vaping when on the go due to its pre-filled e-liquid and simple design. It has a really unique shape that resembles a \u003cem\u003epillow\u003c\/em\u003e. Since e-liquid’s physical and chemical effects are as soft and gentle as a pillow, you don’t need to worry about the flavour.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eProduct Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil : Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePuff : 9000 Puffs\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVolume : 18ML Flavour\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength : 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eE-Liquid \u0026amp; Battery Indicator\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging : Rechargeable with Type C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou may also have a look at \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/elfbar-vapes\" title=\"Elfbar latest models\"\u003eElfbar's latest models\u003c\/a\u003e here.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ELF BAR","offers":[{"title":"Raspberry Passion Fruit Orange","offer_id":41807608414263,"sku":"E B Pi9K (9K P) - Raspberry Passion Fruit Orange","price":1100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pomegranate Berry","offer_id":41807608479799,"sku":"E B Pi9K (9K P) - Pomegranate Berry","price":1100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Razz Ice","offer_id":41807608512567,"sku":"E B Pi9K (9K P) - Blue Razz Ice","price":1100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Berry Raspberry","offer_id":41807608545335,"sku":"E B Pi9K (9K P) - Berry Raspberry","price":1100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Yakult Ice","offer_id":41808950722615,"sku":"E B Pi9K (9K P) - Yakult Ice","price":1100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Strawberry Ice","offer_id":41807608578103,"sku":"E B Pi9K (9K P) - Strawberry Ice","price":1100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Strawberry Yakult","offer_id":41808950755383,"sku":"E B Pi9K (9K P) - Strawberry Yakult","price":1100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Raspberry Elfbull","offer_id":41807608610871,"sku":"E B Pi9K (9K P) - Raspberry Elfbull","price":1100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Refreshing Red","offer_id":41889857962039,"sku":"E B Pi9K (9K P) - Refreshing Red","price":1100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Green Apple","offer_id":41807608643639,"sku":"E B Pi9K (9K P) - Green Apple","price":1100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Cream Tobacco","offer_id":41807608676407,"sku":"E B Pi9K (9K P) - Cream Tobacco","price":1100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blueberry Ice","offer_id":41807608709175,"sku":"E B Pi9K (9K P) - Blueberry Ice","price":1100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pink Lemon","offer_id":41807608447031,"sku":"E B Pi9K (9K P) - Pink Lemon","price":1100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/elf_bar_pi_9000.webp?v=1754262787"},{"product_id":"elfbar-moon-night-40000-puffs","title":"Elfbar Moon Night (40000 Puffs)","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eThe \u003ca title=\"Elfbar\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/elfbar-vapes\"\u003eELFBAR\u003c\/a\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eMoonNight\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e 40K brings next-level convenience, up to 40000 puffs in a single rechargeable device, engineered for long-lasting performance and rich flavour. \u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eMoonNight’s\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e dual mesh coil delivers smoother draws and brighter flavour across fruit, mint and dessert profiles \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf1\"\u003e— from Blue Razz Ice and Blackberry Ice to Dragon \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf1\"\u003eStrawnana\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf1\"\u003e and Pineapple Mango. The result is a consistent, satisfying inhale that highlights each flavour’s character.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e\u003c!--EndFragment --\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e\u003c!--EndFragment --\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eModel: Elfbar 40k Moon Light\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003ePuff Count: \u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e40000 Puffs (Eco Mode), \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e30000 Puffs (Normal Mode), \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e25000 Puffs (Boost Mode).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003ePrefilled Capacity: 22ml\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c!--EndFragment --\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eBattery Capacity: 850mAh (Rechargeable)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eNicotine Strength: 5% (50mg)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eDisplay: Fully curved screen for puff \u0026amp; battery status\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eCharging Port: Type-C fast charging\u003c\/span\u003e