003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmart Digital Display – Always see real-time battery \u0026amp; e-liquid status\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"ELF BAR","offers":[{"title":"Grape Ice","offer_id":42016284049463,"sku":"E W PB45000 (45K P) - Grape Ice","price":2400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Sour Watermelon Drop","offer_id":42016284114999,"sku":"E W PB45000 (45K P) - Sour Watermelon Drop","price":2400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Banana Strawberry","offer_id":42016284180535,"sku":"E W PB45000 (45K P) - Banana Strawberry","price":2400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Kiwi Passion Fruit Guava","offer_id":42016284016695,"sku":"E W PB45000 (45K P) - Kiwi Passion Fruit Guava","price":2400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Cranberry Juice","offer_id":42016284082231,"sku":"E W PB45000 (45K P) - Cranberry Juice","price":2400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue Razz Ice","offer_id":42016284147767,"sku":"E W PB45000 (45K P) - Blue Razz Ice","price":2400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Watermelon Frozen","offer_id":42016284213303,"sku":"E W PB45000 (45K P) - Watermelon Frozen","price":2400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Peach Mango","offer_id":42016267960375,"sku":"E W PB45000 (45K P) - Peach Mango","price":2400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/elfworld-pb45000-banana-strawberry.webp?v=1765240776"},{"product_id":"elfbar-trio-40000-puffs","title":"Elfbar Trio (40000 Puffs)","description":"\u003cp\u003eMeet the Elf Bar Trio 40K — a next-gen premium disposable vape built for vapers who want control, flavor, and serious longevity. Delivering up to 40,000 puffs, this device features an exclusive three-mode flavor system that lets you switch between Sweet, Icy, and Sour profiles anytime. One device, three vibes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith a simple switch, you can change the intensity and flavor experience in seconds—perfect for all-day use without juggling multiple pods. Whether you’re craving smooth sweetness, an icy kick, or a tangy punch, the Trio 40K adapts to your mood instantly, now shop elfbar at best price in Kenya from [YOUR BRAND]!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy Choose \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/elfbar-vapes\" title=\"Elfbar\"\u003eElfbar\u003c\/a\u003e Trio 40K?\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUp to 40,000 real puffs with consistent output\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3 flavor modes: Sweet, Icy \u0026amp; Sour\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInstant flavor control with easy switching\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMulti-coil technology for even heating\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePowerful 850mAh rechargeable battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB-C fast charging\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRich vapor \u0026amp; authentic flavor till the last puff\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"ELF BAR","offers":[{"title":"Blue Razz Ice","offer_id":42085045829687,"sku":"E B Trio (40K P) - Blue Razz Ice","price":2800.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grape Ice","offer_id":42085083217975,"sku":"E B Trio (40K P) - Grape Ice","price":2800.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blueberry Raspberry Ice","offer_id":42085083250743,"sku":"E B Trio (40K P) - Blueberry Raspberry Ice","price":2800.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Peach Ice","offer_id":42089075834935,"sku":"E B Trio (40K P) - Peach Ice","price":2800.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Double Mango","offer_id":42085095669815,"sku":"E B Trio (40K P) - Double Mango","price":2800.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Mix Berry","offer_id":42085095735351,"sku":"E B Trio (40K P) - Mix Berry","price":2800.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Peach Mango","offer_id":42085095768119,"sku":"E B Trio (40K P) - Peach 